## What the tire is telling you

Uneven tread wear, low pressure, vibration at speed, and cracks or bulges in a
sidewall are all worth acting on the day you see them. Most of them are also
symptoms of something that is not the tire: a wear pattern is usually geometry
or suspension, and replacing the tire without fixing the cause buys a few
thousand miles.

We put the numbers behind that in [7 tire maintenance
tips](/articles/7-tire-maintenance-tips-to-prevent-blowouts-and-extend-tire-life).

